<BaseLayout eligible={true} title="About" description="About Rule & Ratio and its publishing mission.">
<h1>About Rule &amp; Ratio</h1>
<div class="prose"><p>Rule &amp; Ratio is an independent legal publishing initiative focused on Indian law. Its aim is to make legislation, judicial reasoning and legal scholarship easier to discover and understand.</p><p>It is currently under development. Rule &amp; Ratio Review is a proposed future academic journal, not an active peer-reviewed or indexed publication.</p><p>The information on this platform is intended for general knowledge and research, not individualized legal advice.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
